---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: AI consulting
description: Xerodonia helps small and medium businesses put AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, Gemini) to work. Fixed-price engagements, Sydney-based, worldwide remote.
permalink: /consulting/
---
{% include "partials/consulting-nav.njk" %}

<section class="hero hero--left">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI consulting · {{ site.location }}</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">AI agents that work like employees, <em>without the payroll.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">Small and medium businesses know they need AI, but most don't know where to start, what's realistic, or how to avoid wasting money. We cut through the hype and deliver measurable outcomes inside your existing workflows.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ site.calendlyUrl }}">Book a free {{ consulting.audit.name }}</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/consulting/services/">Services and pricing</a>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">Free{% if consulting.audit.length %} {{ consulting.audit.length }}{% endif %} session · No obligation · Worldwide remote</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="fit-title">Where do you fit?</h2>
      <p>Not every business is at the same point with AI. Choose the path that sounds like you.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="card-grid">
      {%- for audience in consulting.audiences %}
      <li class="info-card">
        <h3><a class="stretched-link" href="/consulting/{{ audience.slug }}/">{{ audience.card.label }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ audience.card.text }}</p>
        <p class="info-card-more" aria-hidden="true">{{ audience.title }} →</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section features" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="what-title">AI agents that fit your business, not the other way around</h2>
      <p>We don't sell off-the-shelf software. We analyse your workflows, find the highest-value opportunities, and implement agents inside the tools your team already uses.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="feature-grid">
      {%- for item in consulting.whatWeDo %}
      <li class="feature"><h3>{{ item.title }}</h3><p>{{ item.text }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section consulting" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Xerodonia</p>
      <h2 id="why-title">Outcomes, not experiments.</h2>
      <p>We're practitioners, not theorists. Every engagement is focused on real, measurable results in your business.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="checklist">
      {%- for item in consulting.whyUs %}
      <li><strong>{{ item.title }}.</strong> {{ item.text }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 id="pricing-title">Transparent, fixed-price engagements</h2>
      <p>Every service has a clear scope and a fixed price, so you can plan with confidence. All prices are AUD, excluding GST.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="pricing-grid">
      {%- for service in consulting.services | pickServices(["initial-setup", "rehabilitate", "follow-up"]) %}
      {% include "partials/pricing-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="section-more"><a class="text-link" href="/consulting/services/">Full services, fees and integrations <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "Ready to see what AI can do for your business?" %}
{% include "partials/audit-cta.njk" %}
